-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this license, and the asset license
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT permission above covers the SOURCE CODE of this project: the Java
sources, the Gradle build scripts, the tooling under tools/ and scripts/, and
the documentation under docs/.

All GAME ASSETS shipped by this mod are licensed separately under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). This covers, without limitation:

  - textures (items, blocks, entities, particles, GUI, HUD, effects),
  - block models, item models, entity and animation models, blockstates,
  - sprites, fonts, particle definitions and their artwork,
  - sound effects and music,
  - the Patchouli guidebook text and illustrations,
  - the corresponding source material under models/, images/ and sound/.

In practice that is everything under each subproject's
src/main/resources/assets/astral_dice/ directory EXCEPT lang/, plus the asset
source directories named above. Language files live inside the assets
directory but are not assets; the rule that matters is the file type, not
the directory.

Data-driven JSON that defines gameplay (recipes, loot tables, tags,
world generation) and language files (lang/*.json) are NOT assets: they are
covered by the MIT permission above.

License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode
Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 you may copy, redistribute and adapt the assets for
non-commercial purposes, provided that you:

  - give appropriate credit to "Astral Dice" / MerlinKitsune (a link to
    this repository is enough) and indicate whether changes were made;
  - do not use the assets for commercial purposes - paid modpacks, paid
    server access, paid redistribution or resale require prior written
    permission from the copyright holder; free modpacks, videos and
    streams are fine and need no permission;
  - distribute your derivative assets under the same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
    license, without adding further restrictions.

Exceptions: assets owned by third parties keep their own licenses and are
not relicensed here. The currently bundled exception is the Iron Elden Ring
Pixel Particle Library (MIT, by shuimo0413) under
assets/astral_dice/textures/particle/ier/; its full license text and
attribution are in docs/third-party/Iron-Elden-Ring-Particle-library-LICENSE.txt.
